    "title": "",
    "legend": "The tumour consists of uniform small glands and tubular structures formed by a single row of cuboidal or columnar cells and displays a papillary growth pattern. Most papillae are simple and composed of a loose fibrovascular core and bland-looking epithelium arranged in one row or in a bilayered pattern. Some papillae are more complex, with a branching pattern.",
